    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰が追っかけてる地下アイドルの、\r\n限定ライブのチケット──！？",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あっ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010030"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "誰かに聞かれる心配はないから、安心していい\r\n今事務所に人がいないことは確認済だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "さ、さすがプロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──じゃあテンション上げて仕切り直すけど！\r\nなんで、Ｐたんが、それを持っているのですかっ！？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは\r\nまぁ、業界のコネというやつだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "他のアイドルの活動を見るのは勉強になると思うし──\r\n……チケットを取り逃した誰かさんも喜ぶだろうし",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一石二鳥だと思ったんだが、\r\n次の日曜、予定は空いてるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "～～～～っ！！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そんなの空けるに決まってるじゃん！\r\nありがとプロデューサー、愛してるっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010070"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
