  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "大事なことを言い忘れていました\r\n──聞いてください",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、おう……\r\nどうした……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "今だけ……Ｐたんと三峰は──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーとアイドルという関係を\r\nやめるべきだと思うのです",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……おっけー？",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……いや！？\r\n『おっけー』なはずないだろう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "違うのＰたん違うの、聞いて？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰はね、『アイドルの三峰結華がここに来てること』を\r\n知られたくないの",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "アイドルの三峰結華じゃなくて、\r\nただの三峰結華としてライブに行きたいの",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……Ｐたんの力でチケットもらっておきながら、\r\nこんなこと言うのはフェアじゃないと思うんだけどさ……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……ファン心理というか、\r\n三峰の勝手なこだわりというか……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……その……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……結華としては、俺にどう振る舞ってほしいんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──！\r\n付き合ってくれるの！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700601/2007006010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……もともと、お忍びなのは間違いないしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルの三峰結華がここにいるって知られたら、\r\n俺だって困る",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "手伝える範囲は手伝うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006010190,
    "speaker": "結華",
